\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/4795187/pixel-colony\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" data-label=\"related_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"Pixel Colony\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4NjU0NzA2LnBuZw==/original/ICPJIk.png\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">Pixel Colony</h1></div><div id=\"view_html_game_5636598\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_327242\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div data-height=\"360\" data-width=\"640\" class=\"game_frame game_pending\" style=\"width: 640px; height: 360px\"><button class=\"fullscreen_btn\" title=\"Enter fullscreen\"><img src=\"https://itch.io/static/images/enlarge.svg?1788406861\"/></button><div class=\"iframe_placeholder\" data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe scrolling=&quot;no&quot; src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/18434055/index.html?v=1784682150&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" stroke-width=\"2\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"donate\"><a href=\"https://pelzergames.itch.io/pixel-colony/donate\" data-donate=\"true\" class=\"button donate_btn\">Support This Game</a></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p><strong></strong></p>\r\n<p>Build and protect a struggling settlement on a harsh frontier world where severe weather, hunger, failing infrastructure, and scarce resources constantly test your ability to survive.</p>\r\n<p>CURRENT PRE-ALPHA</p>\r\n<p>Storm Frontier is in active development. Features, balance, artwork, interface, performance, and save compatibility may change between builds.</p>\r\n<p>PLAYABLE FEATURES</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Build and expand an isometric colony</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Assign settlers to jobs, hauling, repairs, and production</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Enter fully explorable building interiors</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Survive dynamic weather, storms, lightning, and equipment failures</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Generate and manage power, storage, and resources</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Research new technologies to expand your colony</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Keep settlers fed, healthy, and productive</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Repair and maintain colony infrastructure</p>\r\n<p>IMPORTANT GAMEPLAY BEHAVIOR</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Hungry settlers stop working until they can eat.</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Settlers suspend outdoor work during severe weather.</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Buildings may stop operating when they lack power, workers, resources, storage capacity, or repairs.</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 If production appears stalled, check settler hunger, weather, staffing, power, input resources, and building condition.</p>\r\n<p>TEMPORARILY REMOVED</p>\r\n<p>Regional expeditions are not currently available in this build.</p>\r\n<p>The previous expedition progression could be be completed far too quickly after starting a colony. Its unlocking requirements, pacing, costs, risks, and rewards are being redesigned before it returns.</p>\r\n<p>CURRENT DEVELOPMENT FOCUS</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Opening economy and resource progression</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Settler behavior and visual improvements</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Food and medical balance</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Weather preparation, duration, and recovery</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Interface clarity and readability</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Expedition redesign</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Long-term research and production progression</p>\r\n<p>PLANNED &mdash; NOT YET PLAYABLE</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Reworked regional expeditions</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Expanded ingredients, recipes, morale, and warmth</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Deeper settler personalities and social behavior</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Multiplayer sandbox mode</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Expanded research tree and long-term economy</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Additional frontier regions and larger maps</p>\r\n<p>FEEDBACK</p>\r\n<p>Bug reports and gameplay feedback are welcome.</p>\r\n<p>Before reporting settlers who have stopped working, please check their hunger, current weather, job assignment, building staffing, power, required input resources, storage capacity, and building condition.</p>\r\n<p>For bug reports, please include:</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Build version</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Browser</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Operating system</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 In-game day</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 What happened</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 What you expected</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 What occurred immediately beforehand</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Whether reloading fixed the issue</p>\r\n<p>\u2022 Screenshot (if available)</p>\r\n<p>PRE-ALPHA NOTICE</p>\r\n<p>This build is intended for testing and development feedback. It does not represent the final scope, balance, artwork, interface, performance, or progression of Storm Frontier.</p>\r\n<p>PRICING</p>\r\n<p>Storm Frontier is currently free during pre-alpha testing. Optional donations help support continued development.</p>\r\n<p>CURRENT VERSION</p>\r\n<p>Pre-Alpha 0.1.1</p>\r\n<p>Updated July 2026</p>\r\n<p>Development is active and updates are planned regularly. Thank you for helping shape Storm Frontier during its earliest stages.</p>\r\n<p><strong></strong></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" height=\"6\" width=\"12\" aria-hidden role=\"img\" version=\"1.1\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_5034606\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/in-development\">In development</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HTML5</a></td></tr><tr><td>Author</td><td><a href=\"https://pelzergames.itch.io\">pelzergames</a></td></tr><tr><td>Genre</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/genre-simulati